00:19:16,900 --> 00:19:22,020
With the use of driverless vehicles seemingly inevitable,

196
00:19:22,900 --> 00:19:27,740
mining companies in the vast Australian desert state of Western Australia are

197
00:19:27,740 --> 00:19:29,320
